WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.270
Keep on holding me

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.270
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.150
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.150
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:21.960
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:21.960
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.210
The precious arms

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:32.130
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:32.130
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:39.470
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:39.470
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:48.940
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:48.940
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:56.200
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:56.200
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:04.120
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:04.120
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.090
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.090
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:19.260
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:19.260
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.600
This love...

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.600
Omoi wo

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.780
Get out of my way...

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:39.280
My whole body is tired... and I'm at my limit.

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:41.950
Move!

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:43.700
I Said, MOVE!

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:44.660
No!

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:47.710
Then... What am I supposed to do?

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:49.500
I don't know!

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.090
But if Kurau...

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:57.180
If Kurau's gone, then I can't go on living either!

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:59.760
I won't be able to live...

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:05.930
This feels great.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:32.210
The Gravestones On 
Top Of The Hill

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.390
Papa, Mama...

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:26.600
Uncle, Aunt...

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.500
Are you going to the hill?

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:53.290
Yes.

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:54.880
That's good.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:59.010
I'm sure your parents, your uncle and aunt will be happy.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:08.260
Grandpa, the festival isn't that way.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.390
She's not going to the festival.

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:14.480
That girl had a scar on her face.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:17.020
Don't say such things.

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:45.380
Papa! Mama!

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.280
I'm surprised.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.900
Not only is it a miracle that she's alive...

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.410
But she hasn't even been infected by Rynax.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:57.460
We lost the signal further down the river from here, around this lake.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.090
If he hasn't used his powers since,

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.960
it's highly likely that he's still hiding.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:08.970
Also, the officer who was on the bus with him has disappeared.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.300
Based on the driver's account,

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.390
the boy on the bus was, without a doubt, Yvon Tardieu.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:17.310
Disappeared... So he was erased?

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:18.270
Yes.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:23.650
Inspector Wong, there's something I'd like to ask you.

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:25.440
What is it?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.860
Why attach an observation device to that boy?

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:31.160
The other Ryna sapiens weren't treated like that.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.240
Who is that boy?

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.870
I cannot answer that question.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:48.510
Dear...

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:53.800
Don't worry. I asked the townspeople
not to say anything.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:56.930
We can only hope that they will just pass by.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.290
Are you okay, Kurau?

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:29.720
Thanks... What about the GPO?

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.220
There's lots of them.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.180
We have to get out of here.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:35.970
You're not up to that yet.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:36.720
Shh!

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.110
Here it is.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:23.980
I'm alive.

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:30.780
Who are you? Why are you here?

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:34.240
Why? Well, this is my house.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.030
Your house?!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.410
T-That's right.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.330
What? What is it?

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.920
I can't believe this!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:55.010
You're Rynax, aren't you?

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:56.340
Rynax?

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:02.480
That's why my injury is all better!

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:04.440
Who would've thought this could happen?!

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:08.900
Who are you?

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:14.070
You're my new Pair.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:18.030
That's why you healed my injury.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:23.160
What are you talking about?
If you're feeling better, then leave!

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.080
Why would you say something like that?

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:28.080
Don't tell me you already have a Pair?

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.540
What do you mean, a Pair?

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:36.220
So that means, you don't have a Pair, right?

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:38.010
Whoopee!

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:44.060
Then I'll stay with you!
You and I were meant to be together.

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:50.060
We're alike. I'm sure we can be a pair.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:52.570
How do you know this?

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:01.240
You're crazy. You fell out of the sky, you know.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:05.410
I'm not crazy. After all, I'm Rynax.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:09.420
Get out! Or I'll call someone!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.580
What?

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.630
If you won't leave, then...

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:14.340
Wait!

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.010
Hang on!

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.410
It's not like I have anywhere to go...

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:51.380
You came back!

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:53.460
No, um...

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.170
Ouch!

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:59.090
Are you okay?

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:01.590
You're heavier than I thought.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:05.970
That's okay. Stay like this for a while.

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:16.190
I never thought I'd be able to feel
someone's weight on me.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:20.530
A human body isn't so bad after all...

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:28.950
Are you sick? Your heart's beating real fast.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:33.710
But, isn't that what happens at times like this?

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:36.670
Oh yeah? That's what happens?

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:37.630
Good, then!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:43.590
Are you the only one who lives here?

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:46.850
What about those people in the pictures?

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:49.100
They all died.

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:55.310
Mama and Papa died and I was adopted here.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:59.530
But my uncle and aunt were
killed in a car accident.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:01.650
It's probably my fault.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:07.580
Everyone around me dies. I'm always alone.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:11.960
Don't worry. I'll always be with you.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:15.830
I'll never leave your side. We'll always be together!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.840
My name is Yvon.

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:21.420
I'm Jessica.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.780
Kurau? Christmas?

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.030
Aunt?

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.450
How are you feeling?

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.320
I'm okay now.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:52.410
I'm sorry to trouble you. it's my fault...

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:57.210
No, the GPO isn't here looking for you.

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.210
What?

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.800
They're looking for a boy named Yvon.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.800
Yvon... That was that boy's name.

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:08.680
Kurau, Christmas, here...

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:14.560
Take that and leave here.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:20.900
The GPO will soon come around here too.
Do you remember, Kurau?

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:25.320
Our mountain cabin is further up from here and over the valley.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:29.490
I don't think they would look for you there.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.700
Aunt...

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:36.420
Stay strong, you two.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:39.630
Kurau, take good care of Christmas, okay?

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:41.460
I will.

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.720
Will that boy be captured?

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.140
I don't know.

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:52.600
That boy... I want to help him.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:55.020
I know. I do too.

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:03.280
I want to help him too.

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:07.780
There it is.

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:14.240
Stay there. I'll go take a look.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:15.580
Kurau!

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:24.300
We've finished searching areas B, C and D.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.590
We didn't find the target in any of those areas.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.550
So the only area left is F.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.760
Have you gotten any signals since?

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:33.260
Negative.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:37.180
Search everywhere, not just houses,
for places he may be hiding.

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:38.140
Yes, sir!

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:50.820
No one's home.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:58.410
Wait! Wait!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:14:59.830
Hurry up!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:05.750
Yvon!

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:07.800
Yvon!

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.060
Thank goodness.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:30.400
I won't die. I don't want to die.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:39.830
I wasn't like this before.
I didn't care if I lived or died.

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:45.340
All I wanted was my Pair. But now it's different.

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:47.590
Your warmth, your heartbeat...

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:52.050
The things I've felt from you...
I don't want to ever lose them.

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.300
I want to live.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:56.810
You're the one who saved my life.

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:57.720
What?

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:01.020
If I hadn't seen you then...

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:03.810
I probably would have...

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:09.610
And I don't know why, but when I was taking care of you,

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:14.160
it all felt so familiar to me.
Like we've met somewhere before...

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:18.910
Ever since that accident, I was always anxious,
but suddenly that feeling was lifted...

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.460
You're beautiful.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:31.510
You've taught me something very important.

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:35.640
Being a Pair is far more important than I could have imagined.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:39.930
No matter what happens, I'll be by your side.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:43.640
Yvon, then let's go far away.

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:46.230
To a faraway place that no one knows of.

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:51.610
Let's go. We'll live there. Just the two of us...

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:55.450
Let me say goodbye to Papa and Mama.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:56.530
Okay..

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.160
Not here either.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.630
It's faint... but I feel it.

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:27.650
We've finished searching all areas.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.270
So he's already left this area, has he?

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.610
Tell the Pod unit to withdraw.

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:36.150
We'll move the search headquarters to another location.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:43.500
Papa, Mama, Uncle, Aunt... this is Yvon.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.250
So people become these things when they die?

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:52.880
I didn't know that people
were this fragile and short-lived.

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:54.460
Here.

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:59.010
I'll give this to you. I don't have
anything else to give you.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:02.640
It's to symbolize my promise to you
to stay with you forever.

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:05.310
I want you to have it.

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:20.820
GPO!

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:22.080
I found him!

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:24.490
Our target!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.040
Capture him before he uses his powers!

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:29.540
Run, Jessica!

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:38.300
Activating shield.

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:41.510
Yvon!

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:54.480
Gogo no akarui hizashi no naka warau
You smile in the bright daylight

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:43.720
What?!

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.970
Yvon! Yvon!

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:47.560
Jessica! Jessica!

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:53.320
Run, Jessica! Or you'll get caught too!

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:54.780
Yvon!

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:13.040
Kimi no egao wa itsumo koko ni mukatte
Your smile is always looking towards this way

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:17.420
Suki...
I love you...

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.050
What is this?

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:27.890
Tobira no mukou mabushisugite
The light beyond the door is too bright

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:37.940
Lonely Freedom...

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:32.650
Jessica...

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:34.230
Jessica!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:40.610
Yvon, I understand... I understand now,
the meaning of being a Pair.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:48.370
Lonely Freedom...

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:45.530
I don't ever want to leave your side.

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:49.250
You and I... are a pair...

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:57.300
Lonely Freedom...

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:52.290
Jessica...

00:19:58.300 --> 00:19:59.920
This girl's a Ryna sapien too.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:09.060
Lonely Freedom...

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:03.050
Yvon, I'll help you now.

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:18.780
Stop! Please stop!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:33.250
Jessica! Jessica!

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:45.970
Yvon... You and I will be together...

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:46.930
forev...

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:53.560
Jessica...

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:14.410
J...

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:21.090
Jessica!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:46.910
From a great distance

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:46.910
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
You smile at me

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.420
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.420
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.470
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.470
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.310
Moonlight

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.310
Moonlight

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:11.950
Next Episode

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:13.240
I can't see anything...

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:18.410
I wanted to go somewhere,
but I didn't even know where to go...

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:21.960
In this vast world... I didn't know where to go...

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:24.960
In The Mist
